@if (Model.LessonCode == "PED:US-CCSS-MATH:G7:U07:L01")
{
  <section class="rich-lesson-section" data-g7-u07-l01 aria-label="Grade 7 Relationships of Angles">
    <h3>Relationships of Angles — Edulytiks</h3>
    <h4>Source-aligned focus</h4><p>Recognize and reason with right, straight, and full-turn angle measures. Preserve the existing correct lesson body and use first-party diagrams or physical construction where appropriate.</p>
    <h4>Activity connection</h4><p>Pattern-block angles, protractor reading, and angle composition. Machine Practice checks only closed numerical or categorical subresults; drawing and geometric justification remain teacher reviewed.</p>
    <h4>Cool-down — first-party Edulytiks assessment</h4><p>Three angles around a point measure 120, 95, and 80 degrees. Find the fourth angle. Then classify 90, 180, and 270 degrees and explain why the complete turn totals 360 degrees.</p>
    <p><strong>Teacher review:</strong> Check construction accuracy, diagram labels, units, geometric justification, and written reasoning. This Cool-down is independently authored.</p>
  </section>
}

@if (Model.LessonCode == "PED:US-CCSS-MATH:G7:U07:L02")
