    <h3>Nonadjacent Angles — Edulytiks</h3>
    <h4>Source-aligned focus</h4><p>Identify vertical, complementary, and supplementary angle relationships even when angles are not adjacent. Preserve the existing correct lesson body and use first-party diagrams or physical construction where appropriate.</p>
