    <h4>Cool-down — first-party Edulytiks assessment</h4><p>Two lines intersect and one angle is 64 degrees. Find its vertical angle and both adjacent angles. Separately, find an angle complementary to 28 degrees.</p>
    <p><strong>Teacher review:</strong> Check construction accuracy, diagram labels, units, geometric justification, and written reasoning. This Cool-down is independently authored.</p>
